2269,"global_rank":137556},{"name":"mmiller2321/My-Three-React-Emoji-Hooks","owner":"mmiller2321","html_url":"https://github.com/mmiller2321/My-Three-React-Emoji-Hooks","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"This project changes the state of an Emoji in a React.js project that changes once the user clicks on an Emoji. There are three different hook implementations defined in the README.md located under Project Description.","topics":["components-react","custom-hooks","react","react-hooks","state"],"score":2269,"global_rank":137559},{"name":"walkerj90/Day-Planner","owner":"walkerj90","html_url":"https://github.com/walkerj90/Day-Planner","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2269,"global_rank":137560},{"name":"walkerj90/Coding-Quiz","owner":"walkerj90","html_url":"https://github.com/walkerj90/Coding-Quiz","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2269,"global_rank":137561},{"name":"karmjeetnamol/react_portfolio","owner":"karmjeetnamol","html_url":"https://github.com/karmjeetnamol/react_portfolio","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"This project was bootstrapped with Create React App.  Acceptance Criteria GIVEN a single-page application portfolio for a web developer WHEN I load the portfolio THEN I am presented with a page containing a header, a section for content, and a footer WHEN I view the header THEN I am presented with the developer's name and navigation with titles corresponding to different sections of the portfolio WHEN I view the navigation titles THEN I am presented with the titles About Me, Portfolio, Contact, and Resume, and the title corresponding to the current section is highlighted WHEN I click on a navigation title THEN I am presented with the corresponding section below the navigation without the page reloading and that title is highlighted WHEN I load the portfolio the first time THEN the About Me title and section are selected by default WHEN I am presented with the About Me section THEN I see a recent photo of the developer and a short bio about me WHEN I am presented with the Portfolio section THEN I see titled images of three of the developer\u2019s applications with links to both the deployed applications and the corresponding GitHub repository WHEN I am presented with the Contact section THEN I see a contact form with fields for a name, an email address, and a message WHEN I move my cursor out of one of the form fields without entering text THEN I receive a notification that this field is required WHEN I enter text into the email address field THEN I receive a notification if I have entered an invalid email address WHEN I view the footer THEN I am presented with text or icon links to the developer\u2019s GitHub and LinkedIn profiles.  In the project directory, you can run: npm start Runs the app in the development mode. Open http://localhost:3000 to view it in your browser.  The page will reload when you make changes. You may also see any lint errors in the console.","topics":[],"score":2269,"global_rank":137562},{"name":"MadamHippo/True-Crime-Collective","owner":"MadamHippo","html_url":"https://github.com/MadamHippo/True-Crime-Collective","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"For true crime lovers to discuss real-life crime cases, cold cases, and viral crime news with other real crime fans.","topics":[],"score":2269,"global_rank":137563},{"name":"seagda/employee-tracker","owner":"seagda","html_url":"https://github.com/seagda/employee-tracker","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"This CLI application is built using Node.js to manipulate employee data within a MySQL database pre-populated with tables and seed data. (SQL schema and seed data are available in the accompanying repository.)","topic